Derived portions (files moved/adapted from the upstream repository):

- t2i_core/api.py, t2i_core/metrics.py, t2i_core/render.py,
  t2i_core/storage.py, t2i_core/test.py, t2i_core/util.py
  (upstream src/*.py; imports and configuration plumbing adapted so the
  module can run inside the AstrBot process)
- service/main.py (upstream main.py)
- docs/standalone/ (upstream README*.md, MONITORING.md)
- tests/test_api.py, tests/test_metrics.py, tests/test_storage.py
  (upstream tests, import paths adapted)
- LICENSE (upstream Apache-2.0 license text, unchanged)

Substantial changes made for this repository:

- added an AstrBot plugin entry point (main.py) providing lifecycle hooks,
  chat commands and dashboard Web APIs;
- added t2i_plugin/ (config parsing, Chromium supply/install, embedded
  HTTP service, status/test cards) so no external container is required;
- added pages/t2i/ (dashboard plugin page), _conf_schema.json, metadata.yaml;
- added tests for the plugin layer, tools/envlab/ for containerized
  end-to-end verification, and plugin documentation.

Third-party template assets (NOT covered by the Apache License above):

- t2i_plugin/plugin_templates/atrifeed_diary.html
- t2i_plugin/plugin_templates/atrifeed_diary_legacy.html

  Adapted from astrbot_plugin_atrifeed by Heximiao
  (https://github.com/Heximiao/astrbot_plugin_atrifeed), licensed under the
  GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. These two files are derivative
  works of that project, remain under AGPL-3.0, and are distributed
  separately from the Apache-2.0 code of this plugin. Adaptations: the body
  now renders the AstrBot ``text`` variable as Markdown, the date, weekday,
  character count and render time are filled in by an inline script, and the
  weather / mood slots that only astrbot_plugin_atrifeed can populate are
  reproduced from its src/diary/renderer.py: one of the five weather states is
  picked at random per render, the mood card uses the same two images the
  upstream plugin hard-codes (pic/pictorial/my_atri1/emoji1.jpg and
  pic/emoji/tired/atri_tired1.jpg, cropped and embedded as base64 data URIs)
  together with a random line from its ATRI_ONE_LINERS list. The two
  pic/lihui illustrations (shop/atri6.png, atri2.png) are bundled as well,
  downscaled to 640 px height and re-encoded as WebP data URIs. Layout,
  colours and copy come from the original templates.

